      "ElasticityCell": {
        "description": "One category x freshness band, and whether it means anything.\n\n`elasticity_usable` is null wherever S4.1 could not establish a downward\nslope. That is the field a consumer should read: `elasticity_raw` is what\nthe fit returned, including the cells whose interval covers zero and the\ntwo thin ones that came back at +8.60 and +1.61. Publishing only the raw\nnumber would invite exactly the misreading the estimator exists to prevent.",
        "properties": {
          "discounted_observations": {
            "title": "Discounted Observations",
            "type": "integer"
          },
